Usage Meter is a modified version of LANtern Control. It was not written from
scratch. The original device discovery, ARP engine, packet capture, speed
limits, domain features and user interface come from LANtern Control.

Usage Meter modifications:
- A cumulative per-device usage ledger keyed by MAC address, with download,
  upload and total bytes that survive restarts.
- Usage totals saved to %LOCALAPPDATA%\UsageMeter\usage.json, with settings in
  %LOCALAPPDATA%\UsageMeter\settings.json, using safe writes and backups.
- Total download, total upload and total usage columns in the Windows UI.
- The inherited update check against the LANtern Control releases was removed
  from the Windows application.
- Renamed to Usage Meter, version 1.0.0.

